# ⚠️  KEY ROTATION:
#    1. On your LOCAL machine (where you have the unencrypted key):
#       chezmoi encrypt ~/.ssh/hostinger_id_rsa > dotfiles/private_dot_ssh/hostinger_id_rsa.age
#    2. Commit the new .age file to your dotfiles repo
#    3. Old encrypted key is now invalid — remove from repo history if needed
#
# ⚠️  IF THE KEY IS COMPROMISED:
#    1. Generate new key: ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -f ~/.ssh/hostinger_id_rsa -C "hostinger"
#    2. Add new public key to Hostinger dashboard
#    3. Encrypt new private key with chezmoi
#    4. Commit new .age, remove old one from repo
